    {
      "title": "要換元的例子",
      "prompt": "$y=\\frac{x^3}{3}$，$0\\le x\\le 1$ 繞 $x$ 軸，求旋轉曲面面積。",
      "problemId": "cx-sa-003",
      "steps": [
        "$f'=x^2$，$S=\\int_0^1 2\\pi\\left(\\frac{x^3}{3}\\right)\\sqrt{1+x^4}\\,dx$。",
        "令 $u=1+x^4$，$du=4x^3\\,dx$，$x^3\\,dx=\\frac{du}{4}$；$x=0\\to u=1$，$x=1\\to u=2$。",
        "$S=\\left(\\frac{2\\pi}{3}\\right)\\left(\\frac{1}{4}\\right)\\int_1^2\\sqrt{u}\\,du=\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)\\cdot\\left(\\frac{2}{3}\\right)(2\\sqrt{2}-1)=\\frac{\\pi(2\\sqrt{2}-1)}{9}$。"
      ],
      "answer": "$\\frac{\\pi(2\\sqrt{2}-1)}{9}$",
      "claim": "INT(2*pi*(x^3/3)*sqrt(1+x^4), 0, 1) == pi*(2*sqrt(2)-1)/9"
    }
